(444,1,NULL,'section',83,0,NULL,NULL,'and add it to either side of ????','Square \n????\n2????\nand add it to either side of ????\n2\n+\n????\n????\n????=−\n????\n????\n\n(\n????\n2????\n)\n2\n=\n????\n2????\n×\n????\n2????\n=\n????\n2\n4????\n2\n\n????\n2\n+\n????\n????\n????+\n????\n2\n4????\n2\n=\n????\n2\n4????\n2\n−\n????\n????\n\nRecall that \n????\n????\n=\n????\n2????\n+\n????\n2????\n\n68\n\n????\n2\n+\n????\n????\n????+\n????\n2\n4????\n2\n=\n????\n2\n4????\n2\n−\n????\n????\n\n????\n2\n+\n????\n2????\n????+\n????\n2????\n????+\n????\n2\n4????\n2\n=\n????\n2\n−4????????\n4????\n2\n\nComplete the square \n????(????+\n????\n2????\n)+\n????\n2????\n(????+\n????\n2????\n)=\n????\n2\n−4????????\n4????\n2\n\n(????+\n????\n2????\n)(????+\n????\n2????\n)=\n????\n2\n−4????????\n4????\n2\n\n(????+\n????\n2????\n)\n2\n=\n????\n2\n−4????????\n4????\n2\n\n√(????+\n????\n2????\n)\n2\n=±√\n????\n2\n−4????????\n4????\n2\n\n????+\n????\n2????\n=±\n√????\n2\n−4????????\n√4????\n2\n\n????=−\n????\n2????\n±\n√????\n2\n−4????????\n2????\n\n????=\n−????±√????\n2\n−4????????\n2????\n\n????=\n−????+√????\n2\n−4????????\n2????\nor ????=\n−????−√????\n2\n−4????????\n2????\n\nThe roots/solutions are \n−????+√????\n2\n−4????????\n2????\nand \n−????−√????\n2\n−4????????\n2????\n\nLet us use this formula to answer some few questions. \n<H4>Example 1 \nSolve for x in the following equation. \n2????\n2\n−????−1=0',93,'verified',1,'2026-11-01 01:22:41','Indexed directly from the administrator-verified source resource.','2026-11-01 01:22:41'),
(445,1,NULL,'section',86,0,NULL,NULL,'Substitute, ????=','Substitute, ????=\n6\n????\ninto (2) \n2????+2(\n6\n????\n)=11 \n2????+2(\n6\n????\n)=11 \n2????+\n12\n????\n=11 \nMultiply through by L \n2????\n2\n+12=11???? \n2????\n2\n−11????+12=0 \nSolve the quadratic equation, either by factorising or using the quadratic formula: \n2????\n2\n−3????−8????+12=0',95,'verified',1,'2026-11-01 01:22:41','Indexed directly from the administrator-verified source resource.','2026-11-01 01:22:41'),
